.DS_Store
__pycache__/

# Eval run artifacts and raw result JSON: machine-generated, and they embed
# absolute paths from the machine that ran them, which the leak test fails
# on. The written-up markdown in docs/ is the artifact worth keeping.
**/evals/results/
docs/*.json

# Worktrees the build skill creates. ~/.claude is not involved here; this
# is the repo-local .claude/ the flow uses for its own worktrees.
.claude/
